-- Ordered quest guidance; source 967020b2b8ca645afcaf90d9bbe5a1b64673947d; generated 2026-10-20.
QuestGuidance.Register("en",361,{
[11521]="7002F985\n1\tTalk to Léofcetel and convince him to ride along with Captain Garmund\tLéofcetel can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving. Garmund has asked you to convince the Rider Léofcetel to join him on his errand.\n2\tTalk to Captain Garmund outside Cliving\tCaptain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving. Léofcetel has refused to ride along with Garmund and his men and has asked the Captain to consider the consequences.\n3\tRide with Captain Garmund across the plains\tCaptain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving. Captain Garmund wishes to set forth at once, to prevent further destruction to the farms of the crofters of Cliving.\n4\tTalk to Captain Garmund\tCaptain Garmund can be found at the western watch-tower, just west of Cliving. Garmund wishes to convey thanks after the difficult encounter on the fields outside Cliving.\n",
[11522]="700431B7\n1\tTalk to Angbor\tAngbor can be found outside Tumladen in Upper Lebennin. You have delivered Terenis's warning to Lord Angbor. He bears a missive from Aragorn that must be brought to the Lady at once.\n2\tTalk to Lady Terenis\tLady Terenis can be found in her hall in the rear of Tumladen in Upper Lebennin. You have delivered Aragorn's missive to Lady Terenis, and should now aid her as Lord Angbor requested.\n",
[11523]="7001D0D4\n1\tBurn banners of Dol Guldur (total: 8)\tBanners of Dol Guldur can be found throughout Gathbúrz.\n2\tTalk to Rodelleth at Thangúlhad\tRodelleth is at Thangúlhad in Gathbúrz. You should return to Rodelleth with tidings of your success.\n",
[11524]="70048CA6\n1\tDestroy Stained Totems (total: 7)\tStained Totems can be found in Faltor Gâm, the village of the Infected Orcs. You should destroy Stained Totems.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron can be found at Viznak's Hideout. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[11525]="7004295C\n1\tTalk to Tom Bombadil and retrieve Bingo's manuscript\tTom Bombadil can be found outside his house in the Old Forest during the day, and relaxes inside during the evening. Bingo has asked you to retrieve his manuscript from Tom Bombadil, and to learn what the mysterious fellow thought of it.\n2\tTalk to Bingo outside the house of Tom Bombadil\tBingo is outside the house of Tom Bombadil, and now you should give him the news that Tom has misplaced Bingo's manuscript.\n3\tFind Bingo's manuscript somewhere outside near Tom Bombadil's house\tTom Bombadil may have set Bingo's manuscript down outside somewhere near his house, and Bingo has asked you to see if you can find it.\n4\tSearch north of Tom Bombadil's house for more pages of Bingo's manuscript\tYou found some pages of Bingo's manuscript on the path leading north from Tom Bombadil's house. Did the wind bring other pages further north?\n5\tTalk to Bingo outside the house of Tom Bombadil\030Talk to Marigold outside the house of Tom Bombadil\tYou found some pages of Bingo's manuscript, but there are still some pages missing. You should return to speak with Bingo and Marigold outside the house of Tom Bombadil to decide upon a course of action.\n6\tDefeat barghests in the Barrow-downs (total: 6)\030Defeat crawlers in the Barrow-downs (total: 4)\030Find the section of manuscript concerning Bingo's swimming lesson\030Find the section of manuscript concerning Bingo's departure from the Shire\tThe wind carried pages of Bingo's manuscript into the northern Barrow-downs, and you should search for them. Marigold has also asked you to defeat barghests and crawlers while you search.\n7\tTalk to Bingo outside the home of Prisca Boffin, in Newbury\tBingo said he would meet you outside his cousin Prisca's home in Newbury once you were finished in the Barrow-downs.\n8\tTalk to Marigold Boffin outside her mother's home in Newbury\030Talk to Prisca Boffin outside her home in Newbury\tMarigold and Prisca Boffin are outside their home in Newbury, and each of them wishes to speak with you.\n9\tTalk to Bingo outside Prisca's home, in Newbury\tBingo is outside his cousin Prisca's home in Newbury, across the Brandywine Bridge from the Shire.\n",
[11526]="7002F796\n1\tCollect vases from Sâd Torech (total: 4)\tVases can be found in Sâd Torech. Aldbéort has asked you to collect pitch-filled vases from Sâd Torech.\n2\tTalk to Aldbéort\tAldbéort is at Cliving. Aldbéort will be pleased to receive the pitch-filled vases.\n",
[11527]="7002F304\n1\tDefeat drakelings and bats in Sâd Torech (total: 10)\tDrakelings and bats can be found at Sâd Torech. Aldbéort asked you to clear some of the drakelings and bats from Sâd Torech.\n2\tTalk to Aldbéort\tAldbéort is at Cliving. Aldbéort will be pleased to hear the drakeling and bat population in Sâd Torech has been thinned.\n",
[11528]="7004428C\n1\tDefeat Sûhalar patrols (total: 4)\030Destroy Sûhalar barricades (total: 8)\tEasterlings can be found across the River Forant in southern Talath Anor. You should defeat Sûhalar patrols and destroy Easterling barricades.\n2\tSpeak with Ingold\tIngold can be found at the northern gate of the Rammas. You should speak with Ingold.\n",
[11529]="700370F6\n1\tThe people of Marton can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of town. You should deliver Agelwyn's decree to the people of Marton.\t\n2\tSpeak with Agelwyn\tAgelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton. You should speak with Agelwyn.\n",
[11530]="700371BA\n1\tThe people of Marton can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of town. You should ask the people of Marton what they think should be done: Retreat to Helm's Deep, or fight to with back the town.\t\n2\tSpeak with Agelwyn\tAgelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton. You should speak with Agelwyn.\n",
[11531]="700371BB\n1\tThe people of Marton can be found in the refugees' hiding spot north of town. You should ask the people of Marton what they think Agelwyn should do next.\t\n2\tSpeak with Agelwyn\tAgelwyn is in the refugees' hiding spot north of Marton. You should speak with Agelwyn.\n",
[11532]="7000B2BA\n1\tTalk to Tad Leafcutter\tTad Leafcutter can be found outside the Bree Hunting Lodge west of the South-gate of Bree. Tad Leafcutter has asked that adventurers in Bree come and speak with him.\n",
[11533]="70035997\n1\tStitch fur blankets for the people of Wildermore (quantity: see journal)\tHildelith has given you a recipe for fur blankets. You should stitch fur blankets for the cold refugees at Forlaw.\n2\tDeliver the fur blankets to Hildelith\tHildelith is in Forlaw. You have stitched fur blankets, and should now deliver them to Hildelith.\n",
[11534]="700377C7\n1\tDefeat Uruk-hai pillagers (total: 6)\tUruk-hai pillagers can be found along the edges of the road to the south-west of Entwade. Thane Edric has asked that you clear the road south of foes as his wife, Léoflad, continues to prepare her people to journey south to Aldburg.\n2\tTalk to Thane Edric\tThane Edric can be found outside the Mead Hall of Entwade in Kingstead. You have defeated many Uruk-hai along the road south of Entwade and have secured safe passage for Léoflad and her people. You should return to Thane Edric.\n",
[11535]="70020A51\n1\tSteal the recipe for Fern Beer\030Steal the recipe for Gunderic's Ale\030Steal the recipe for Rootknot's Cider\030Steal the recipe for Perry's Porter\tThe very precious Inn League recipes can be found throughout the Shire -- in Stock outside the Golden Perch, in the Great Smials of Tuckborough, in the Brockenborings Watch Office, and in Waymeet. The dwarf Jónar has asked you to steal the recipes of the now-famous Inn League bests: Fern Beer, Gunderic's Ale, Perry's Porter, and Rootknot Cider.\n2\tBring the stolen recipes to Jónar at Thorin's Hall\tJónar eagerly awaits you at the inn in Thorin's Hall. You should return with the recipes to Jónar, for he will wish to hear all that has passed during your brushes with the members of the Inn League.\n",
[11536]="7006BC52\n1\tContaminate supplies in Khûn Sagaz (total: 4)\030Gather weapons in Khûn Sagaz (total: 4)\tEnârshan has provided you with the Idâmi concoction to use on the supplies in Khûn Sagaz to weaken them. She also instructed you to take from them any weapons you find.\n2\tReturn to Enârshan\tReturn to Enârshan in the Falls of Ilûritu and let her know you have used her concoction on the supplies and taken what weapons you could.\n",
[11537]="7002780F\n1\tFind Elain at the watch-tower\tElain awaits you at the watch-tower in Trum Dreng, on a hill to the east of Lhan Tarren. You should join Elain at the watch-tower and see what can be done about the Dragon-clan invaders there.\n",
[11538]="70047BAB\n1\tTalk to Golasgil\tGolasgil can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. Lord Aragorn has asked you to talk to Golasgil.\n2\tCollect kegs of ale (total: 8)\030Gather soldiers (total: 8)\tYou can find soldiers and kegs in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. Golasgil has asked you to gather soldiers and kegs of ale.\n3\tTalk to Golasgil\tGolasgil can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. You should speak with Golasgil and tell him the kegs and soldiers have been gathered.\n4\tToast with Golasgil\030Cheer at Golasgil\tJoin Golasgil and the men in toasting to those who fell on the Pelennor.\n5\tSing with Golasgil\tJoin Golasgil in singing Authlin's Song to lift the hearts of the gathered men.\n6\tTalk to Golasgil\tGolasgil can be found in the Camp of the Host, on the northern edge of North Ithilien. The celebration has gone off without a hitch. Now you should talk to Golasgil.\n",
[11539]="70049675\n1\tDefeat Kala-gijak look-outs (total: 8)\tKala-gijak look-outs can be found in the archer towers in Kala-gijak. You should defeat Kala-gijak look-outs.\n2\tTalk to Faeron\tFaeron can be found outside Kala-gijak. You should talk to Faeron.\n",
[11540]="7002C250\n1\tCollect weapons from defeated Orcs (total: 8)\tThe tribe of Orc vandals is south-west of the Cuthstan. Lanbert has asked you to search defeated Orcs for suitable weapons and to return them to him at his camp.\n2\tTalk to Lanbert at the Cuthstan-camp\tLanbert is at the Rohirrim-camp at the base of the Cuthstan. Lanbert is awaiting your return with suitable weapons taken from the Orcs.\n",
[11541]="700442F6\n1\tTravel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation\tEryn Cordovath is located north-west of Crithost. Travel to Eryn Cordovath and assess the situation.\n2\tDefeat Orcs in Eryn Cordovath (total: 8)\tOrcs can be found with Eryn Cordovath. You should defeat Orcs in the orchard.\n3\tTalk to Tolwin\tTolwin can be found in the hall of Crithost. You should speak with Tolwin.\n",
[11542]="70071CD7\n1\tDestroy goblin weapon racks (total: 6)\030Defeat Lugadúr in Glúkroz\tGo to Glúkroz and destroy goblin weapon racks and defeat Lugadúr, chieftain to the goblins. Glúkroz can be found north-east of Sen Chatâk.\n2\tReturn to Ahâto in Sen Chatâk\tReturn to Ahâto in Sen Chatâk to report on Lugadúr's demise.\n",
[11543]="70040B04\n1\tCollect crates (total: 8)\tFind crates bound for Dol Amroth, scattered around the town of Tadrent.\n2\tReturn to Haelam with the crates\tHaelam can be found in the village of Tadrent. Return to Haelam with the crates.\n",
[11544]="7002908D\n1\tFind Tomos in the wild\tTomos has escaped his forced labour to look into doing something about the Dragon-clan menace in Pren Gwydh. You should seek out Tomos and help him so that he can return before the White Hand Overseers notice that he is gone.\n",
[11545]="7004CE49\n1\tTake the stack of notices\tThe stack of notices is in the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should take the stack of notices.\n2\tPost notices in Lake-town (total: 10)\tNotices can be posted in places all around Lake-town. You should post notices around Lake-town.\n3\tTalk to Álarr\tCaptain Álarr can be found in the guards' barracks in Lake-town. You should talk to Álarr.\n",
[11546]="7003FFF1\n1\tGather fish from nets in the river Blackroot (total: 8)\tFish can be found in nets in the Blackroot outside Sardol in south-western Blackroot Vale. You have discovered fishing nets in the river Blackroot and should gather fish to aid the people of Sardol.\n2\tCompleted\tYou have recovered many fish from the nets along the river Blackroot.\n",
[11547]="700621A1\n1\tTalk to Calargyl\tMaeriel has asked you to talk to her fellow Ranger, Calargyl about what you all saw and did here in Sedgemead. Calargyl is near Amon Firn, in north-eastern Cardolan.\n",
[11548]="7007177D\n1\tComplete Instance: Taking a Rest\tKhagâmi is tired from her travels west through An Shêru, and is ready to settle in for the night.\n2\tTalk to Khagâmi\tAs you and Khagâmi talked at the camp-fire, you were attacked by a group of bandits. You were able to defend yourself with unexpected help from Faeron, Ranger of the Grey Company. You should talk to Khagâmi about the evening's adventure.\n3\tGo to the Rangers' camp\tAfter defending your encampment with unexpected help from Faeron, the Ranger invited you to his camp atop the nearby hill.\n4\tTalk to Rhadrog\tFaeron invited you to his camp atop the nearby hill, and there you found his companion, Rhadrog. You should talk to him.\n",
[11549]="700272C2\n1\tAccompany Léofward to the Mustering Tree\tLéofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in the Gravenwood. You should let Léofward know when you are ready to depart for the Mustering Tree.\n2\tTalk to Léofward at the Rohirrim scout-camp\tLéofward is at the Rohirrim scout-camp in the Gravenwood. You should return to Léofward to discuss the battle at the Mustering Tree.\n",
[11550]="70037E76\n1\tReady the horse at Pendlac's Farm\tThe horses can be found near the farmhouse at Pendlac's Farm in south-eastern Kingstead. Agelman has asked that you ready a horse for him as he prepares Léoflad's body for travel back to Entwade.\n2\tTalk to Agelman\tAgelman can be found at your side or can be rallied by sounding your horn. You have readied the horse, and should now speak to Agelman before sending him back to Entwade.\n",
[11551]="70071CD9\n1\tSpeak with Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna\tSpeak with Doorward Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.\n2\tDefeat Ordâkhai forces in Zajâna near Lajór (total: 14)\tDefeat Ordâkhai forces near the Hall of Lajór in Zajâna. The Hall of Lajór is located in the eastern end of Zajâna.\n3\tSpeak with Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna\tReturn and report your success to Azagâya outside of the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.\n4\tReport back to Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna\tReport back to Mizâdi outside the Shorakhúna in Zajâna.\n",
[11552]="7001B692\n1\tTaking the Morvith Bridge\t\n",
})
